{
  "id": "E278",
  "title": "Chinese Style Romance",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2018-12-02",
  "synopsis": "Is it romantic to eat noodles?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/916/766890476e134ba1171f13b032194475fcf2a715.mp3?1542078332",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "中国式浪漫\n\n保罗：小乐，和你一起吃面条，真浪漫！\n小乐：浪漫？吃面条有什么浪漫的？\n保罗：不是有一首中文歌吗？“我能想到最浪漫的事，就是和你一起吃吃面条。”\n小乐：你听错了！不是一起“吃吃面条”，是一起“慢慢变老”。\n保罗：什么，一起变老？这有什么浪漫的？\n小乐：两个人一直在一起，这样不浪漫吗？",
    "traditional": "中國式浪漫\n\n保羅：小樂，和你一起吃麵條，真浪漫！\n小樂：浪漫？吃麵條有什麼浪漫的？\n保羅：不是有一首中文歌嗎？“我能想到最浪漫的事，就是和你一起吃吃麵條。”\n小樂：你聽錯了！不是一起“吃吃麵條”，是一起“慢慢變老”。\n保羅：什麼，一起變老？這有什麼浪漫的？\n小樂：兩個人一直在一起，這樣不浪漫嗎？"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Chinese Style Romance"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "保罗：小乐，和你一起吃面条，真浪漫！",
      "traditional": "保羅：小樂，和你一起吃麵條，真浪漫！",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó xiǎo lè hé nǐ yì qǐ chī miàn tiáo zhēn làng màn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Little Le, having noodles with you is so romantic!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小乐：浪漫？吃面条有什么浪漫的？",
      "traditional": "小樂：浪漫？吃麵條有什麼浪漫的？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè làng màn chī miàn tiáo yǒu shén me làng màn de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: Romantic? How is having noodles romantic?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "保罗：不是有一首中文歌吗？“我能想到最浪漫的事，就是和你一起吃吃面条。”",
      "traditional": "保羅：不是有一首中文歌嗎？“我能想到最浪漫的事，就是和你一起吃吃麵條。”",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó bú shì yǒu yì shǒu zhōng wén gē ma wǒ néng xiǎng dào zuì làng màn de shì jiù shì hé nǐ yì qǐ chī chī miàn tiáo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Isn’t there a Chinese song? “The most romantic thing I can imagine is to have noodles with you.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小乐：你听错了！不是一起“吃吃面条”，是一起“慢慢变老”。",
      "traditional": "小樂：你聽錯了！不是一起“吃吃麵條”，是一起“慢慢變老”。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè nǐ tīng cuò le bú shì yì qǐ chī chī miàn tiáo shì yì qǐ màn man biàn lǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: You heard wrong! It’s not “having noodles” together. It's “slowly growing old” together."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "保罗：什么，一起变老？这有什么浪漫的？",
      "traditional": "保羅：什麼，一起變老？這有什麼浪漫的？",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó shén me yì qǐ biàn lǎo zhè yǒu shén me làng màn de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: What? Growing old together? How is that romantic?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "小乐：两个人一直在一起，这样不浪漫吗？",
      "traditional": "小樂：兩個人一直在一起，這樣不浪漫嗎？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè liǎng ge rén yì zhí zài yì qǐ zhè yàng bú làng màn ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: Two people being together forever. Is that not romantic?"
    }
  ],
